    "*   **Resolution of Asymmetric Information Gaps:** Unlike traditional price-based technical indicators, such as the Relative Strength Index (RSI), which are purely reactive to past price action, this index captures the **ex-ante psychological state** of market participants. Deep troughs in the index (the red shaded regions) quantify **\"Crowd Anxiety.\"** In a market-timing context, these surges in anxiety represent information cascades that can serve as leading signals for potential market corrections or regime shifts.\n",
